OL,3,GNEWSAFarm defends Titanic-themed ride
OL,4,Aafter backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FManager Will Campbell-Gray said: "We're
OL,7,Fkeeping the memory of Titanic alive and
OL,8,Fwe're not making fun of the dead at
OL,9,Fall."
